('stripe-api','Stripe','api','Payments, subscriptions, invoices. Idempotent writes, cursor pagination.','REST API with idempotency keys, cursor pagination and webhooks. One of the most reliable contracts an agent can build on.','Bearer secret key','https://api.stripe.com/v1','https://docs.stripe.com/api',ARRAY['payments','billing'],'approved'),
('notion-api','Notion','api','Pages, databases and blocks as structured JSON. Rate limit ~3 req/s.','Structured content API. Good fit for knowledge-retrieval agents; watch the ~3 req/s rate limit.','Bearer integration token','https://api.notion.com/v1','https://developers.notion.com/reference/intro',ARRAY['docs','knowledge'],'approved'),
('resend-api','Resend','api','Transactional email with a single POST. Ideal for agent side effects.','Single-endpoint transactional email. Minimal surface, easy for an agent to call correctly.','Bearer API key','https://api.resend.com/emails','https://resend.com/docs/api-reference/introduction',ARRAY['email'],'approved'),
('linear-api','Linear','api','GraphQL issue tracker. Strong schema, great for planning agents.','GraphQL API with a strict schema, which makes tool-call generation reliable.','API key header','https://api.linear.app/graphql','https://developers.linear.app/docs',ARRAY['issues','graphql'],'approved'),
('supabase-mcp','Supabase MCP','mcp','Query and mutate Postgres, inspect schema, manage projects over MCP.','Remote MCP server exposing database, schema and project management tools.','OAuth 2.1 / PAT','https://mcp.supabase.com/mcp','https://supabase.com/docs/guides/getting-started/mcp',ARRAY['database','sql'],'approved'),
('github-mcp','GitHub MCP','mcp','Repos, issues, pull requests and code search as first-class tools.','Official remote MCP server for GitHub, with OAuth 2.1 and fine-grained tool scopes.','OAuth 2.1','https://api.githubcopilot.com/mcp','https://github.com/github/github-mcp-server',ARRAY['code','vcs'],'approved'),
