('gh-cli','gh','cli','GitHub from the shell. `gh pr create`, `gh issue list --json` for parsing.','Machine-readable output via --json makes this one of the best agent-native CLIs.','gh auth login','gh <command> --json','https://cli.github.com/manual/',ARRAY['vcs','json-output'],'approved'),
